%SIXMD 1
# @?REV - REVERSE S6REC RECORDS

## DESCRIPTION

REVERSES THE CHARACTERS OF EACH S6REC RECORD FROM STANDARD INPUT.

USAGE IS 'REV'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/REV
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/REV.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

